{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Egg appears in the goblin camp. Naturally, the goblins decide it must be destroyed!\u00a0Harvest it to gain resources, upgrade your town and get strong enough to take it down!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>It's big. It's mysterious. They must break it!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit goblins, assign their roles and combine their unique skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745230/extras/4bd61c74639bb7276432cccccc603ac6.poster.avif?t=1772087239\" width=800 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745230/extras/4bd61c74639bb7276432cccccc603ac6.webm?t=1772087239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745230/extras/4bd61c74639bb7276432cccccc603ac6.mp4?t=1772087239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Get Rich</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your economy by collecting different type of eggs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745230/extras/3d9117c2df3780e1e2ab68c2c5376799.poster.avif?t=1772087239\" width=800 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745230/extras/3d9117c2df3780e1e2ab68c2c5376799.webm?t=1772087239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745230/extras/3d9117c2df3780e1e2ab68c2c5376799.mp4?t=1772087239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Goblins are not very smart. Boost their productivity, upgrade their abilities and unlock new units and mechanics\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745230/extras/42aad0b648a5bf404f549c1b1adc828a.poster.avif?t=1772087239\" width=800 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745230/extras/42aad0b648a5bf404f549c1b1adc828a.webm?t=1772087239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745230/extras/42aad0b648a5bf404f549c1b1adc828a.mp4?t=1772087239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Prestige - Meta progression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do it again! Customize your future runs with unique abilities.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745230/extras/40d6f54d888de45eb709e71ef665776a.poster.avif?t=1772087239\" width=800 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745230/extras/40d6f54d888de45eb709e71ef665776a.webm?t=1772087239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745230/extras/40d6f54d888de45eb709e71ef665776a.mp4?t=1772087239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3745230?t=1772087239","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745230/39915a3abb095043da77d8de13101a2429dae185/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772087239","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745230/0d08736f0cb87a44aaafb2ab6aacfd5b2fb5e689/capsule_231x